    <description>Button on Contact related list for Opportunity, replaces the normal new button.
Ensures that users cannot create an Accelerared opportunity record type when an Account is in Accelerated Lockout period.

Doesn&apos;t require Type, Source, or Lead Type like normal opportunity pages.

S3P-1158 - Created.</description>
